                        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
                            Your discreet connection to our dedicated team. We ensure every interaction is handled with the utmost priority and absolute confidentiality.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden lg:block relative group">
                        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-primary/5 blur-2xl rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"></div>
                        <div class="relative w-48 h-48 flex items-center justify-center border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-full">
